{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/92ad646c41960be5b70cf33161cf19b9.avif?t=1771913679\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras_big/92ad646c41960be5b70cf33161cf19b9.avif?t=1771913679 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Backstory</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boundless barrens veil like a celestial prison. In the darkness forged by the unyielding law, planets adrift like faint candle flames, spinning, guttering.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A death-sentenced prisoner who lost his memory escapes from the realm of prison: Gibetuary. On the journey, travel through the eerie realms like Ignysium and Tidesong, witness the peoples struggling for survival while reuniting the long-lost allies and reclaim everything they have torn away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind the veil of these realms, traces of the Gods loom near. Seemingly, they are capable of spurring the evolution of a people like miracles. Yet with absolute indifference, they may wipe out a realm\u2019s value.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are they?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nurturers? Overseers? Or executioners?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are they gods who answer prayers, or the nemesis of all who strive for their people\u2019s survival?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When a condemned soul stands at the threshold of a darkened future, facing those deities who temper fates\u2014can he still voice his questions?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who am I?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How come my crime?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why was I born\u2026 and why must I die?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/83fd5817d4141e613898fa99516f0e76.poster.avif?t=1771913679\" width=606 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/83fd5817d4141e613898fa99516f0e76.webm?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/83fd5817d4141e613898fa99516f0e76.mp4?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Brand-new Experience</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling non-stop combo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock weapons, learn skills, customize your own fight style with various chips</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/9d9c7374a9d87223da57333a4b975775.poster.avif?t=1771913679\" width=606 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/9d9c7374a9d87223da57333a4b975775.webm?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/9d9c7374a9d87223da57333a4b975775.mp4?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Sci-fi style Chinese mythologies</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Chinese mythological characters in a sci-fi world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore with Xingtian and Nubris. Fight against Kuafu and Ilona</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore various landscape</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to different realms, witness exotic views and cultures, unravel the mysteries hidden deep.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair armors, update AI. Explore more areas with new abilities or open up short-cut</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/773e544632b33d060a24eac3e726b056.poster.avif?t=1771913679\" width=606 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/773e544632b33d060a24eac3e726b056.webm?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/extras/773e544632b33d060a24eac3e726b056.mp4?t=1771913679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Who you are &amp; Where you go</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the condemned prisoner, retrieve your memory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reforge the long-lost connection with your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together embark on the journey of rebelling the Gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2774370?t=1771913679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/dd4f258ba57d05141cfa71dbf6791c8ded0fc880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771913679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/061fa236392b4b030d3e931851924cea3a8bf16a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771913679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774370/0